      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Combining aspirin with ibuprofen should not be done without medical guidance, as it can affect your stomach and interact with medications. A single, focused dose of ibuprofen for the calf is fine, but for the chest tightness, you need a proper assessment. If you are truly concerned about your chest, please do not rely on over-the-counter drugs to manage it overnight.",
